._1958-058).jpg","art":"schnitt","urheber":"National Fruit Collection, Brogdale","lizenz":"OGL 2.0","quelle":"nfc-commons","titel":"Cross section of Reinette Coulon, National Fruit Collection (acc. 1958-058)"},{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Apfel_027_Coulons_Renette_%28fcm%29.jpg/960px-Apfel_027_Coulons_Renette_%28fcm%29.jpg","seite":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Apfel_027_Coulons_Renette_(fcm).jpg","art":"frucht","urheber":"Photograph: Frank C. Müller , Frankfurt am Main","lizenz":"CC BY-SA 4.0","quelle":"commons-fotos","titel":"Apfel 027 Coulons Renette (fcm)"},{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/Apfel_028_Coulons_Renette_%28fcm%29.jpg/960px-Apfel_028_Coulons_Renette_%28fcm%29.jpg","seite":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Apfel_028_Coulons_Renette_(fcm).jpg","art":"frucht","urheber":"Photograph: Frank C. Müller , Frankfurt am Main","lizenz":"CC BY-SA 4.0","quelle":"commons-fotos","titel":"Apfel 028 Coulons Renette (fcm)"},{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/CoulonRenetteP1060749.jpg/960px-CoulonRenetteP1060749.jpg","seite":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:CoulonRenetteP1060749.jpg","art":"frucht","urheber":"Don Manfredo","lizenz":"CC BY-SA 4.0","quelle":"commons-fotos","titel":"CoulonRenetteP1060749"},{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/91/Coulons_Renette.jpg/960px-Coulons_Renette.jpg","seite":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Coulons_Renette.jpg","art":"frucht","urheber":"Bahnmoeller","lizenz":"CC BY-SA 3.0","quelle":"commons-fotos","titel":"Coulons Renette"},{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/02/Deutsche_Pomologie_-_Aepfel_-_031.jpg/960px-Deutsche_Pomologie_-_Aepfel_-_031.jpg","seite":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Deutsche_Pomologie_-_Aepfel_-_031.jpg","art":"tafel","urheber":"Wilhelm Lauche","lizenz":"gemeinfrei","quelle":"lauche1883","titel":"Deutsche Pomologie - Aepfel - 0